rows.en:
Scary...?
Why...?
He keeps me bound to him only because he loves me that much.{p}

A reason...?
...I suppose so.
Anyone would answer that way if they were suddenly asked something like this.{p}

Heh heh heh...
Very well.
I wonder what type would suit you best, {a}.{p}

You really are picky, aren't you?
Maybe that's why you don't have a sweetheart.
You haven't truly fallen in love yet.{p}

A bright red candle rose up in my mind.
Its flame flickering, the candle was burning down fast...
...Maybe I really didn't have much time left.{p}
